===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Someone with all or part of their head shaved, notably a [[tonsure]]d [[clergyman]]; often used as a [[derogatory]] comment directed at priests or monks.
# A [[shaver]], [[stripling]], young man physically ripe enough to shave.

